  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "CivicLabel",
      "text": "Grant Project Summary"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Print stories together"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicLead",
      "text": "Propose four two-hour printmaking sessions with 12 places each, followed by a short review of…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicAmount",
      "text": "USD | Request $4,000 | Estimated cost $5,000 | Confirmed $0"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicMeta",
      "text": "PST-01 | Imani Brooks | 2 Nov–18 Dec 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Audience: Adults interested in trying printmaking"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "The proposed case"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Could a small evening programme offer a useful first chance to try printmaking?"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "E01 suggests limited interest in an evening route; E02 supplies a provisional capacity. Neither…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "E01 Imagined interest notes"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicMeta",
      "text": "Source date 2026-10-12 | Count 8 of 12"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Eight of twelve respondents selected an evening creative session; four did not."
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Limit: A small convenience sample does not establish wider demand, enrollment or a commitment to attend."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "E02 Imagined room planning note"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicMeta",
      "text": "Source date 2026-10-14 | Planned capacity 12 places"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A draft room layout allows twelve working places."
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Limit: This is a planning assumption, not a reservation, access assessment or venue approval."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The next decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Validate access needs, venue availability and costs before choosing a funder and adapting to its…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicLink",
      "text": "Delivery and evaluation — page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicLink",
      "text": "Costs and funding assumptions — page 3"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicMeta",
      "text": "Fictional proposal — no delivery, funding or outcomes claimed"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicFolio",
      "text": "1 / 3"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Delivery and evaluation"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Planned outputs are distinct from hoped-for benefits. No observed result is supplied."
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Capacity: 48 attendance places. Target: 36 attendances from 24 distinct adults; repeat visits are not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Three proposed phases"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "How the work would be checked"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicMeta",
      "text": "Observed results: not recorded. Targets and coverage are plans, not achieved outcomes."
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicNote",
      "text": "Participation does not imply permission to display work. Confirm a separate choice before sharing any…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CivicLink",
      "text": "Costs and funding assumptions — page 3"
    },
    {
